 # Mission 1: Contact Insurgents
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_20000:0 "Echoes in the Snow"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_20000:0 "Agents disguised as traders make first contact with tribal leaders and monks wary of foreign presence but desperate for aid."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_20000:0 "Sympathetic figures in monasteries and villages quietly pledge loyalty and pass messages to more remote rebel elements."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_20000:0 "An initial resistance network is established in the Kham and Amdo regions, awaiting arms and orders."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_SUCCESS_20000:0 "Contacts across Tibet have been established and are eager for support. Our spiritual intermediaries provide plausible cover, and safehouses now dot the highlands. Local trust is fragile but present — a base for rebellion has been seeded."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_FAILURE_20000:0 "Contacts proved unreliable or were compromised. Our teams were shadowed by Chinese intelligence, and one cell was eliminated. Surviving operatives must retreat, leaving behind an unstable web of half-formed alliances."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_20000:0 "Whispering Winds"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_20000:0 "Sacred Oaths"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_CONTACT_20000:0 "Spark of Rebellion"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20000:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # Mission 2: Weapon Smuggling
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_20001:0 "ST BARNUM: Weapons Above the Clouds"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_20001:0 "CIA pilots and Tibetan guides map high-altitude drop zones shielded from radar and patrols."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_20001:0 "B-17s and C-47s drop crates of WWII-era rifles, mortars, radios, and medicine into snowy valleys."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_20001:0 "Resistance cells retrieve the cargo and begin arming fighters for initial skirmishes."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_SUCCESS_20001:0 "Hundreds of resistance fighters are now armed. The drops were successful and covert. These weapons will enable sustained ambushes on convoys and outposts. Enemy supply lines face serious disruption in the coming months."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_FAILURE_20001:0 "Poor weather and detection led to misdrops and confiscated crates. Resistance morale is shaken, and the Chinese are tightening border patrols. Enemy propaganda now circulates photos of our captured equipment."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_20001:0 "Pathfinding the Peaks"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_20001:0 "Angels in the Dark"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_SMUGGLE_20001:0 "Mountain Reapers"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20001:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # Mission 3: Exfiltration to Camp Hale
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_20002:0 "ST CIRCUS: Ghosts on the Border"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_20002:0 "CIA operatives and Tibetan intermediaries identify promising young rebels and monks across Kham and Amdo for elite training abroad."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_20002:0 "Infiltration teams guide the candidates across the Himalayas to safehouses in India and Nepal, avoiding PLA patrols and altitude threats."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_20002:0 "Using forged documents and diplomatic backchannels, recruits are flown discreetly to the United States via Asia-Pacific air corridors."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_SUCCESS_20002:0 "A select group of Tibetan rebels has been successfully exfiltrated to the United States. Though few in number, they are bright, loyal, and ideal candidates for future operations. Their safe arrival marks the beginning of a new insurgent elite."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_FAILURE_20002:0 "Chinese border patrols intercepted several convoys. Survivors fled or were captured, with some reportedly tortured. The plan has been exposed, and future recruitment will face resistance. Trust among villages has faltered."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_20002:0 "The Chosen Few"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_20002:0 "Through Ice and Silence"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_EXFIL_20002:0 "Tickets to the West"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20002:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # Mission 4: Camp Hale Training
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_20003:0 "ST CIRCUS: Camp Hale Initiative"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_20003:0 "Recruits arrive at Camp Hale, Colorado. The cold, thin air mirrors their homeland. Instructors begin cultural immersion and basic indoctrination."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_20003:0 "Training intensifies: demolitions, ambush tactics, cold-weather survival, encrypted communication, and spiritual resilience. CIA veterans oversee all modules."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_20003:0 "Graduation ceremonies are held quietly. The best are selected for immediate redeployment; others remain to instruct future classes."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_SUCCESS_20003:0 "The first wave of Tibetan fighters has completed training at Camp Hale. Their skills now rival elite partisans, and they are deeply motivated. Some may remain in the U.S. to train new recruits, while others return for direct action."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_FAILURE_20003:0 "Several recruits struggled physically or mentally. One may have attempted contact with foreign press. While some graduates are usable, the operation now risks exposure and must be carefully scaled back."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_20003:0 "Arrival at Altitude"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_20003:0 "Warriors of the Wind"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_TRAIN_20003:0 "Mountain Ghosts Reforged"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20003:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # Mission 5: Insertion into Tibet
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_20004:0 "ST CIRCUS: Return of the Thunder Spirits"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_20004:0 "Graduates are flown to clandestine airfields in Nepal and prepared for covert reentry under new identities and tactical loadouts."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_20004:0 "Insertion via HALO jumps or land infiltration occurs during sandstorms or blizzards, aided by loyalist guides."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_20004:0 "Each team is tasked with setting up rebel cells, establishing caches, and launching low-risk ambushes to test their local reach."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_SUCCESS_20004:0 "The return of Camp Hale veterans has lit a fire under the resistance. Their technical knowledge and combat leadership is multiplying rebel effectiveness. Cells are reporting higher morale, better coordination, and meaningful successes."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_FAILURE_20004:0 "The insertions went awry. One group was dropped off-course, another was killed during border crossing. The failure casts doubt on the value of U.S.-based training for insurgents, and local resistance has suffered a setback in confidence."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_20004:0 "Crosswinds of Fate"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_20004:0 "Nightfall Across the Plateau"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_HALE_INSERT_20004:0 "Flames Reignite"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20004:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # Mission 6: Sabotage Railway
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_20005:0 "Operation Windstorm"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_20005:0 "Tibetan scouts and CIA spotters monitor train schedules and patrol rotations along key tracks."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_20005:0 "Explosives are delivered and planted beneath key trestles and supply hubs during bad weather."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_20005:0 "Multiple sabotage events are triggered in coordinated strikes."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_SUCCESS_20005:0 "The Qinghai–Tibet railway is severed at multiple points, delaying troop deployments and vital supplies. The PLA is forced to divert units for repairs and security, creating openings elsewhere."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_FAILURE_20005:0 "Saboteurs were captured or killed mid-mission. Some charges were defused, and enemy security is now overwhelming. Several villages have been targeted in retaliation, weakening local support for the rebellion."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_20005:0 "Eyes on the Iron Serpent"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_20005:0 "Silken Charges"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_SABOTAGE_20005:0 "Shattered Arteries"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20005:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # Mission 7: Psychological Warfare
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_20006:0 "ST BAILEY"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_20006:0 "CIA broadcasts in Tibetan begin airing anti-communist spiritual messages from clandestine radios."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_20006:0 "Fake PLA orders and ghost-written leaflets are distributed claiming Chinese soldiers are cursed for occupying holy land."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_20006:0 "The PLA struggles with morale as whispers spread of divine punishment and unrest among Tibetan conscripts."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_SUCCESS_20006:0 "Desertions spike among PLA Tibetan auxiliaries. Our spiritual propaganda resonates deeply, especially in monasteries. Enemy morale is visibly eroded and garrison forces are more paranoid and overextended."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_FAILURE_20006:0 "Chinese authorities jammed our broadcasts and arrested leaflet distributors. The psychological front has failed, and our disinformation has backfired, with increased surveillance in monasteries and schools."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_20006:0 "Echoes on the Wind"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_20006:0 "Divine Warnings"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_PSYOPS_20006:0 "Seeds of Doubt"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20006:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # Mission 8: Dalai Lama Exfiltration
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_20007:0 "Escape of the Bodhisattva"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_20007:0 "Agents infiltrate Lhasa and coordinate with loyalist monks to prepare the Dalai Lama’s escape."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_20007:0 "The Dalai Lama and entourage escape in disguise, navigating treacherous terrain with CIA intelligence and Tibetan scouts."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_20007:0 "The Dalai Lama safely reaches India, sparking global awareness and galvanizing Tibetan resistance in exile."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_SUCCESS_20007:0 "The Dalai Lama has escaped Chinese capture and now resides safely in India. His story electrifies the world, bolstering support for the Tibetan cause. Our moral position is elevated, and exile networks grow rapidly."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_FAILURE_20007:0 "Chinese forces intercepted the escape attempt. Several bodyguards were killed, and the Dalai Lama is now a closely monitored prisoner. The Tibetan resistance has lost its most potent symbol and morale collapses."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_20007:0 "Shadows on the Path"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_20007:0 "Crossing the Veil"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_DALAI_20007:0 "Bodhisattva in Exile"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20007:0 "Completion Reward\n Will §YSecure§! the §YDalai Lama§! and facilitate his escape from Tibet\n Establishment of a §YTibetan§! §CGovernment-in-Exile§! in §YIndia§!"

 # === Mission 9: Crimson Silence ===
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_20008:0 "Crimson Silence"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_20008:0 "CIA analysts and locals identify PLA officers responsible for monastery purges and village reprisals."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_20008:0 "Operatives infiltrate Chinese barracks, waiting for isolated targets using disguises and insider tips."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_20008:0 "Key officers are eliminated. The act is publicly blamed on 'internal betrayal' to avoid a diplomatic crisis."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_SUCCESS_20008:0 "Several key Chinese commanders have been assassinated. The PLA leadership is shaken, triggering internal purges and confusion. Tibetan morale surges as villagers spread stories of divine vengeance."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_FAILURE_20008:0 "The assassins were caught mid-operation, revealing the extent of CIA involvement. Crackdowns intensify and international backlash mounts. Intelligence assets in the region are heavily compromised."
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_20008:0 "Names from the Oracle"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_20008:0 "The Cold Blade"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_ASSASSINATE_20008:0 "Martyrs Remembered"
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20008:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # Mission 10: Thunder Over the Plateau
 Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_20009:0 "Thunder Over the Plateau"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_20009:0 "The Drums Begin"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_20009:0 "Storm in the High Valleys"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_20009:0 "The Fire Rises"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_20009:0 "Camp Hale veterans, local cells, and spiritual leaders are brought into final alignment. Arms caches are distributed and encrypted signals sent. The resistance prepares to rise in concert."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_20009:0 "Coordinated strikes erupt across villages, rail lines, and garrisons. Armed rebels aim to overwhelm isolated PLA units and rally civilian support. The timing is crucial — too soon and they fail, too late and they’re crushed."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_20009:0 "With enough ground secured, the insurgency declares open rebellion. Provisional leadership emerges, and exile figures begin issuing communiqués to the global press."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_SUCCESS_20009:0 "The Tibetan resistance has erupted in a coordinated national uprising. Though the struggle continues, key towns and routes are in rebel hands. Propaganda videos and photos are already circulating globally. For the first time, the international community sees Tibetan self-determination not just as an ideal — but a reality worth defending."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_CIA_TIBET_UPRISING_FAILURE_20009:0 "The uprising faltered before it began. Communications were compromised, cells were intercepted, and PLA reinforcements preemptively surged into the region. Entire villages have vanished in retaliatory sweeps. The dream of Tibetan self-rule now lies buried beneath avalanche and ash."
 CIA_TIBETAN_REWARD_ENTRY_20009:0 "Completion Reward\n "


  # === Mission 1: Whispers in Rome ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_20050:0 "Whispers in Rome"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_20050:0 "Taverns and Telegrams"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_20050:0 "Old Flags Unfurled"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_20050:0 "The Whisper Network"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_20050:0 "Our operatives arrive in Rome, Athens, and Trieste places where exiled Albanians drink, talk, and dream of returning home. Their loyalty will be tested."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_20050:0 "Former members of the Balli Kombëtar and monarchist officers begin holding secret councils. Royalist and republican factions both demand recognition and support."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_20050:0 "An initial clandestine network is formed with communication routes to SIS and CIA handlers. The stage is set for future insertions and operations."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_SUCCESS_20050:0 "A stable exile network has been formed in Italy and Greece, linking monarchists, republicans, and Western handlers. Trust is still fragile, but the framework for long-term coordination is now active. Safehouses, radio codes, and informants are secured and plans for the first incursions are underway."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_NETWORK_FAILURE_20050:0 "Infighting between monarchists and republicans quickly derailed efforts to unify the Albanian émigrés. Several informants may have been compromised. SIS confidence is shaken, and the CIA is cautious. The operation will need to recover lost ground before progress can continue."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20050:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # === Mission 2: The Iron Channels ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_20051:0 "The Iron Channels"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_20051:0 "Contact the Corsairs"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_20051:0 "Gunmetal in Crates"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_20051:0 "Ashore at Nightfall"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_20051:0 "We reach out to smugglers and ex-Navy men in Corfu, Bari, and Kotor. Many served before or during the war and are familiar with Albania’s southern coastlines."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_20051:0 "Old British surplus weapons and American crates are disguised as farm tools and mining supplies. They are loaded onto fishing boats and trawlers under cover of night."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_20051:0 "Crates are offloaded along quiet coves near Himara and Saranda. Local contacts bury the shipments for future recovery by trained cells."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_SUCCESS_20051:0 "Dozens of crates containing rifles, mortars, radios, and medical kits have been safely hidden along the Albanian coast. Our smugglers remain undiscovered. Resistance fighters will now have what they need to survive and strike when the time comes."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SMUGGLE_FAILURE_20051:0 "A boat was intercepted off the Ionian coast. Others turned back after warning signals. The operation has drawn attention, and local collaborators may be under watch. While some crates landed successfully, the majority have either vanished or were confiscated."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20051:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # === Mission 3: Crosses at Midnight ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_20052:0 "Crosses at Midnight"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_20052:0 "The Hidden Crossroads"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_20052:0 "Oaths and Ashes"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_20052:0 "Voices in the Pines"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_20052:0 "Messengers from our network meet local elders, clan intermediaries, and ex-partisan elements in Albania’s rugged north. Many speak in code, in whispers, and only at night."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_20052:0 "Old blood oaths are renewed over graveyards and church ruins. Family names and betrayals are tallied. Some groups demand proof that they will not be abandoned again."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_20052:0 "Trust slowly builds. Messages are now passed via coded carvings and arranged stones. We begin receiving local intelligence and offers to form rural safehouses."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_SUCCESS_20052:0 "Clan-based and rural contacts inside Albania are cautiously aligning with our goals. A fragile chain of trust has formed between local elders, tribal leaders, and ex-insurgents. While unstable, this hidden network allows us to operate deeper inside the country."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CONTACT_FAILURE_20052:0 "Our envoys were rebuffed or vanished. Some local groups suspect betrayal, or worse infiltration. A meeting place was reportedly surrounded the following morning. The countryside is colder and quieter now, and few are speaking to outsiders."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20052:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # === Mission 4: Operation Fiend ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_20053:0 "Operation Fiend"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_20053:0 "The Camps of the Lost"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_20053:0 "Blades in Exile"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_20053:0 "Doctrine of the Fiend"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_20053:0 "CIA and SIS agents begin gathering Zogist veterans and KBK fighters from displaced persons camps in Italy and Greece. Royalist officers are offered command posts."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_20053:0 "The exiles are trained in demolitions, mountain warfare, and sabotage tactics. Training occurs in remote facilities under British and American supervision."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_20053:0 "A coherent doctrine is instilled, blending partisan experience from WWII with modern clandestine warfare. Select operatives are chosen for near-future insertion into Albania."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_SUCCESS_20053:0 "A hardened core of paramilitary operatives has been trained and organized under Western instruction. These fighters are prepared for infiltration and long-term sabotage inside Albania. The first units stand ready for deployment."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PARAMIL_FAILURE_20053:0 "Training efforts were delayed by infighting, poor discipline, and ideological disputes between republican and monarchist elements. Several recruits deserted, and some may have leaked details to hostile observers. Operational readiness is seriously impaired."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20053:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # === Mission 5: Silent Airfields ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_20054:0 "Silent Airfields"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_20054:0 "Signal from Corfu"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_20054:0 "The Black Shoreline"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_20054:0 "Gone Before Sunrise"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_20054:0 "Staging begins from small ports in Corfu and southern Italy. Crews are selected for silence, local familiarity, and plausible deniability. Insertions are planned around patrol gaps."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_20054:0 "Boats travel at night with lights off and engines cut near the shore. Trained fighters disembark under cover of terrain and are led by pre-contacted guides inland."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_20054:0 "If successful, each team will vanish into the landscape, build safehouses, and begin collecting intelligence or preparing attacks."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_SUCCESS_20054:0 "Multiple squads were inserted without detection along Albania’s southern coast. Contact has been made with at least two local collaborators. These units are now embedded, establishing radio relays and safe caches for further operations."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_INSERTION_FAILURE_20054:0 "At least one boat was intercepted near Saranda, and another went dark after a storm. Survivors may be hunted or detained. Enemy coastal patrols have visibly intensified. Future insertions will face higher risk."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20054:0 "Completion Reward\n "
 
 # === Mission 6A: Crown and Blood ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_20056:0 "Crown and Blood"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_20056:0 "The King’s Men"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_20056:0 "Flags of the Lost Kingdom"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_20056:0 "Brothers of the Crown"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_20056:0 "Royalist agents reach out to old officers, tribal leaders, and émigrés who served under King Zog I. Appeals are made through honor, religion, and revenge against communism."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_20056:0 "Recruitment is formalized through clan councils and exile veteran groups. Balli Kombëtar leaders seek guarantees that their role will be respected after liberation."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_20056:0 "A monarchist chain of command is formed, reinforced with royalist symbols, formal oaths, and promises of a restored Albanian kingdom under Western protection."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_SUCCESS_20056:0 "A strong core of monarchist fighters now stands ready. Their loyalty to the Crown is unshakable, and many claim descent from noble families or tribal lords. The royalist banner is once again raised not in ceremony, but in war."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_MONARCHIST_FAILURE_20056:0 "Tribal rivalries, mistrust of foreigners, and infighting among monarchist factions have delayed progress. Some cells have gone dark, and several leaders refused to swear allegiance without direct support from the Zog family. The royalist cause may fracture further without results soon."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20056:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # === Mission 6B: People’s Dawn ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_20057:0 "People’s Dawn"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_20057:0 "The Broken Vanguard"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_20057:0 "Letters from the Free"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_20057:0 "The Second Sunrise"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_20057:0 "Former partisans, student leaders, and liberal dissidents are quietly approached through exile communities in France, Yugoslavia, and Greece. Many still believe in socialism just not Hoxha’s version."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_20057:0 "Recruitment grows through underground publications and radio broadcasts. Republican-minded Albanians see a future without monarchy or dictatorship only liberation."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_20057:0 "Cells form under secular leadership and a new civilian committee-in-exile. Their aims: defeat the regime, hold elections, and restore Albanian dignity through the people, not royal blood."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_SUCCESS_20057:0 "A disciplined republican network has emerged, focused on restoring Albania through democratic governance and modern nationalist ideals. These fighters reject both monarchy and Marxism, giving voice to a third Albanian future one they are willing to die for."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_REPUBLICAN_FAILURE_20057:0 "Internal disputes over ideology, tactics, and leadership have hampered the republican movement. Some potential leaders refuse foreign backing. Without clear direction or shared vision, the cause risks dissolving into idealism without action."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20057:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # === Mission 7: Kin Over Country ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_20058:0 "Kin Over Country"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_20058:0 "Bloodlines in the Hills"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_20058:0 "Flesh Before Flag"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_20058:0 "The Silent Kin"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_20058:0 "In the mountainous north, loyalty often lies with blood before ideology. Clan leaders are contacted discreetly, using relatives of fighters or exile intermediaries to bridge generations of mistrust."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_20058:0 "Resistance is seeded not through politics but family honor. Messages are passed through marriages, funerals, and whispered stories. Entire kin networks may now shield rebels out of tradition, not ideology."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_20058:0 "Stay-behind caches are built. Sons and cousins are quietly pledged to our cause, with hunting rifles and heirlooms stashed in caves. The enemy may own the capital but not the mountains."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_SUCCESS_20058:0 "Clan-based resistance cells are now embedded across the north. Their loyalty runs through bloodlines, not broadcast ideology. These stay-behind units offer intelligence, protection, and the first lines of rebellion when the time comes."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_CLANS_FAILURE_20058:0 "Kin loyalty proved more fragile than expected. Some chiefs suspect foreign betrayal, others demand family-specific concessions. In at least one case, a relative turned informant. The mountains remain quiet and closed."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20058:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # === Mission 8: Mosque and Memory ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_20059:0 "Mosque and Memory"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_20059:0 "Echoes of the Minaret"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_20059:0 "Faith in Ruins"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_20059:0 "Divine Resistance"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_20059:0 "Messages are broadcast from foreign transmitters invoking Allah, tradition, and the sacred duty to resist atheistic tyranny. Phrases from the Qur'an and local saints stir old memories."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_20059:0 "Leaflets and whispered rumors speak of divine retribution and martyrs buried under the rubble of demolished mosques. Former imams are contacted through exile clerical networks."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_20059:0 "We aim to fracture regime legitimacy among believers, especially in regions where Islam and Catholicism once held sway. When faith rises, fear follows."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_SUCCESS_20059:0 "The regime’s anti-religious campaigns are backfiring. Secret prayer circles are growing. Believers view our cause as sanctified. PLA morale in religious areas is declining some commanders even request atheist commissars for 'discipline.' The seeds of spiritual revolt have been sown."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_PSYOPS_FAILURE_20059:0 "The population remains silent. Either out of fear or indifference, religious messaging has failed to take root. One radio broadcast was jammed, and several leaflet drops never reached the intended targets. Faith alone will not topple the regime at least not yet."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20059:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # === Mission 9: Fire from the North ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_20060:0 "Fire from the North"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_20060:0 "Watch the Tracks"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_20060:0 "Wires and Waxpaper"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_20060:0 "Scars in the Earth"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_20060:0 "Operatives map key rail lines and convoys moving through the northern provinces. Watchmen in isolated homes take note of garrisons, train patterns, and inspection routines."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_20060:0 "Teams plant explosives under trestles, bridges, and cargo rail junctions. Sabotage is coordinated to occur simultaneously across multiple targets."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_20060:0 "If successful, these strikes will cripple enemy logistics and shift PLA focus away from anti-insurgency operations, buying time for rebellion to gather strength."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_SUCCESS_20060:0 "Multiple railway lines are down. Freight shipments are delayed, and troop movements are rerouted into longer, more vulnerable paths. The regime is scrambling to secure infrastructure, and we now have a tactical advantage across the region."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_SABOTAGE_FAILURE_20060:0 "Several charges failed to detonate. One team was compromised by local militia. The PLA quickly contained the disruption and is now reinforcing critical junctions. Resistance in the north may face direct retaliation in the coming weeks."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20060:0 "Completion Reward\n "

 # === Mission 10: Uprising at Dusk ===
 Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_20061:0 "Uprising at Dusk"
 PHASE_1_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_20061:0 "The Long Shadow"
 PHASE_2_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_20061:0 "The Signal Fires"
 PHASE_3_Operation_TITLE_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_20061:0 "The Crimson Break"
 PHASE_1_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_20061:0 "Cells go silent as plans for general rebellion are finalized. Supply caches are confirmed, leadership roles established, and radio codes set. The hour approaches."
 PHASE_2_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_20061:0 "Coordinated attacks erupt across key regions: Tirana’s outskirts, mountain passes, and coastal roads. Saboteurs cripple communications while fighters emerge from clan valleys and exile-trained units rally loyalists."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_20061:0 "The uprising is in motion. The outcome now depends on unity, firepower, and whether the people truly believe the regime can fall. Foreign media scramble to catch whispers of civil war in Albania."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_SUCCESS_20061:0 "The uprising has caught the regime off guard. Major cities face open revolt, and guerrilla units now control swaths of rural territory. Though victory is not assured, the people are rising, and Hoxha’s rule no longer appears invincible. The revolution has begun and the world is watching."
 PHASE_3_Operation_DESC_OP_VALUABLE_UPRISING_FAILURE_20061:0 "The signal was sent, but the uprising faltered. Misinformation, betrayal, and premature strikes led to chaos. PLA units swarmed rebel strongholds, and executions began within hours. The movement is in ruins, its leaders dead or disappeared. The dream of a free Albania has turned to ash."
 OP_VALUABLE_REWARD_ENTRY_20061:0 "Completion Reward\n "

